{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"statistics-lesson05","version":1,"title":"数理統計","subtitle":"第5回 · 元の資料6・正規母集団の区間推定","scope":"数理統計6.pdf、全12物理ページ。元の資料6・正規母集団の区間推定。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期木１]数理統計/数理統計6.pdf","sha256":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4","pageCount":12,"reviewedPages":[3,6,7,9,11,12],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"statistics-l05-q01","version":1,"prompt":"独立なN(μ,σ²)標本n個で、σ>0は既知。Z∼N(0,1)の上側α/2点をz、標本平均を\\(\\bar X\\)とする。μの信頼度1−αの両側信頼区間は？","answer":"\\([\\bar X-z\\sigma/\\sqrt n,\\ \\bar X+z\\sigma/\\sqrt n]\\)。","criterion":"標本平均±上側点×標準誤差と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計6.pdf","page":6,"imageKey":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:6"}],"promptHtml":"独立なN(μ,σ²)標本n個で、σ&gt;0は既知。Z∼N(0,1)の上側α/2点をz、標本平均を<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar X</annotation></semantics></math></span>とする。μの信頼度1−αの両側信頼区間は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\bar X-z\\sigma/\\sqrt n,\\ \\bar X+z\\sigma/\\sqrt n]</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"標本平均±上側点×標準誤差と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l05-q02","version":1,"prompt":"独立なN(μ,σ²)標本n≥2個でσ>0は未知。標本平均は\\(\\bar X\\)、不偏分散はS²、自由度n−1のt分布の上側α/2点はt。μの信頼度1−αの両側信頼区間は？","answer":"\\([\\bar X-tS/\\sqrt n,\\ \\bar X+tS/\\sqrt n]\\)。","criterion":"自由度n−1のt上側点とSを使えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計6.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:9"}],"promptHtml":"独立なN(μ,σ²)標本n≥2個でσ&gt;0は未知。標本平均は<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、不偏分散はS²、自由度n−1のt分布の上側α/2点はt。μの信頼度1−αの両側信頼区間は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\bar X-tS/\\sqrt n,\\ \\bar X+tS/\\sqrt n]</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"自由度n−1のt上側点とSを使えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l05-q03","version":1,"prompt":"独立な正規標本n≥2個の不偏分散S²から母分散σ²>0の信頼度1−αの両側信頼区間を作る。\\(P(\\chi^2_{n-1}>c_p)=p\\)とすると、その区間は？","answer":"\\([(n-1)S^2/c_{\\alpha/2},\\ (n-1)S^2/c_{1-\\alpha/2}]\\)。","criterion":"下限は大きい上側点で割り、上限は小さい上側点で割れれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計6.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:11"}],"promptHtml":"独立な正規標本n≥2個の不偏分散S²から母分散σ²&gt;0の信頼度1−αの両側信頼区間を作る。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\chi^2_{n-1}&gt;c_p)=p</annotation></semantics></math></span>とすると、その区間は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[(n-1)S^2/c_{\\alpha/2},\\ (n-1)S^2/c_{1-\\alpha/2}]</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"下限は大きい上側点で割り、上限は小さい上側点で割れれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l05-q04","version":1,"prompt":"母分散既知の正規母平均の信頼区間で、信頼度を固定し、標本数を4倍にすると区間の幅は何倍？","answer":"1/2倍。","criterion":"幅が標本数の平方根に反比例すると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計6.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:7"}],"promptHtml":"母分散既知の正規母平均の信頼区間で、信頼度を固定し、標本数を4倍にすると区間の幅は何倍？","answerHtml":"1/2倍。","criterionHtml":"幅が標本数の平方根に反比例すると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l05-q05","version":1,"prompt":"同じ標本数と既知の母分散で、正規母平均の信頼度を95％から99％へ上げると、両側信頼区間の幅はどうなる？","answer":"広くなる。","criterion":"信頼度を上げると幅が広がると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計6.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:7"}],"promptHtml":"同じ標本数と既知の母分散で、正規母平均の信頼度を95％から99％へ上げると、両側信頼区間の幅はどうなる？","answerHtml":"広くなる。","criterionHtml":"信頼度を上げると幅が広がると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l05-q06","version":1,"prompt":"Z∼N(0,1)の上側α点zαは、どの確率を満たす値？","answer":"\\(P(Z>z_\\alpha)=\\alpha\\)。","criterion":"右側の裾確率がαと言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計6.pdf","page":3,"imageKey":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:3"}],"promptHtml":"Z∼N(0,1)の上側α点zαは、どの確率を満たす値？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Z&gt;z_\\alpha)=\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"右側の裾確率がαと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l05-q07","version":1,"prompt":"互いに独立な2つの正規標本群から、母平均の差と母分散の比を比較する。母分散の比の推定で使う分布は？","answer":"F分布。","criterion":"F分布と言えれば正解。","explanation":"この資料では2標本問題の導入まで。具体的なF分布の式や推定手順はまだ出題しない。","sources":[{"file":"数理統計6.pdf","page":12,"imageKey":"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:12"}],"promptHtml":"互いに独立な2つの正規標本群から、母平均の差と母分散の比を比較する。母分散の比の推定で使う分布は？","answerHtml":"F分布。","criterionHtml":"F分布と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":"この資料では2標本問題の導入まで。具体的なF分布の式や推定手順はまだ出題しない。"}],"sourceImages":{"85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:6":"./assets/sources/85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4-6.png","85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:9":"./assets/sources/85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4-9.png","85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:11":"./assets/sources/85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4-11.png","85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:7":"./assets/sources/85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4-7.png","85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:3":"./assets/sources/85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4-3.png","85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4:12":"./assets/sources/85a7c7c7e6add6f163a272841b5cf44007cc3eb2eccfb68f004e42935e2808c4-12.png"},"renderVersion":1}